    "description": "<p>Binder Cuffs are Durasteel restraints designed to lock two limbs of a prisoner together, normally the wrists or ankles, but it is possible to lock one arm to one leg or use the Binder Cuffs to hook a prisoner to a tree. The cuffs have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> score of 10, 20 hit points, and a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> score of 40. Breaking them requires a DC 30 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> check, and removing them without the seven-digit release code requires a DC 25 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check. The Binder Cuffs can be attached to the limbs of any creature of Large, Medium, or Small size. </p>",
